OL,3,ALatest UK inflation figure to be
OL,4,Areleased with rate expected to rise
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe latest UK inflation figure is due
OL,7,Fto be released at 07:00 BST
OL,9,FEconomists expect the rate to have
OL,10,Frisen above 3% in the year to August,
OL,11,Flargely due to fuel prices
OL,13,FInflation hit 2.9% in July - its
OL,14,Fhighest level for four months
OL,16,FWhat is inflation? It measures the
OL,17,Fincrease in the price of something over
OL,18,Ftime - the Bank of England has a target
OL,19,Fof keeping the rate at 2%
